fixture cam_look_walk_off
doc Camera review round 3: run to the end of a one-way platform, crouch with the stick down to look over the edge (BUILD.md s5 look-down), then walk off into the drop just looked at: the look eases out while the fall's look grows, so the view never swings up against Ash
room test/cam_oneways
spawn 960 640
frames 220
input
  0..34 R
  35..129 D
  130..219 R
end
expect
  during 40..129 state=ground crouch=1
  mark off 130..219 state=air
end
